%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% readme_HMR_System_bif_exact_v.txt
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% In this directory we integrate the HMR neurons system, and compute it's
% bifurcation diagram;
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Here we list the main files:
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% HMR_signal.m -> this function computes the chaotic signal of the HMR neurons
% system; only one neuron is involved;
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% plot_HMR_signal_v2.m -> this function computes and plots the dynamics of chaotic 
% HMR neurons model; thie file uses the auxiliary function [HMR_signal.m];
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% HMR_X_exact_bif_diagram_v3.m -> this file computes the bifurcation diagram
% for the chaotic HMR neurons model; the computed results are saved in the 
% data file [result_exact_v.mat]; the bifurcation diagram is computed from
% the time series which is computed by this same program; 
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% plot_bif_exact_v.m -> this function plots the bifurcation diagram for the
% HMR neurons model; this function is used in the file 
% [HMR_X_exact_bif_diagram_v3.m];
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% result_exact_v.mat -> this data file contains points of the bifurcation diagram
% of the HMR neurons model;
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Xvt.mat -> this data file contains dynamics of the x(t) variable of the HMR
% neurons model;
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
